cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, cite it as below."
title: "Bonsai 2 27B Ternary Quantization Forensics"
abstract: >-
  Independent forensics of Bonsai 2 27B (Prism ML), a ~2 bpw ternary model
  built from Qwen3.8-27B. Recovers the storage format and Walsh-Hadamard
  rotation basis, localizes the quality gap to trained weight movement rather
  than the quantizer, and shows that a widely cited public PTQ baseline is a
  calibration-passage artifact. Redistributes no model weights.
type: software
authors:
